===============================================================================

- Raft write = leader append + quorum replicate + commit
- Majority ACK defines safety
- Prefix = common matching history
- Suffix = missing/conflicting tail
- Backfill repairs suffix only
- Slow because quorum + fsync + RTT
- CP under CAP
- Prevents split brain
- Great for metadata + critical writes
- Does NOT replace 2PC
